WEBVTT

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:11.140
Man, I had way too much to drink last night.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.210
Ah, my apologies.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:39.240
Um... would there happen to be someone named Ukon-sama here?

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.740
Uh, y-yeah...{"a-aa", he is saying yes to the question}{u bet ur ass}

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:42.740
Um,

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:45.300
is something the matter?

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:49.550
And here I thought I'd seen it all.

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:52.880
I see. I really shouldn't be surprised anymore.

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:53.760
Pardon?

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:58.870
Considering there are people around here with animal ears and tails,

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:00.860
I can deal with a talking bird.

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.260
U-Um...

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:04.700
I'm sorry for being so surprised.

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:08.900
You have quite a pretty voice.

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:13.300
Oh, there you are, Rurutie-sama.

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.030
Ukon-sama!

00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:16.860
Hey, kid.

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:20.140
What, you two have already met?

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:24.110
Ukon, you're friends with bird people too?

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:31.040
U-Um...

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:34.140
I'm not a bird...

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:10.980
I'll introduce you. This is the youngest princess of Kujuuri,

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:12.630
Rurutie-sama.

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:15.470
She arrived early this morning.

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:18.790
N-Nice to meet you.

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:23.610
Our job this time around is to escort her to the capital.

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:25.090
The capital?

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:28.490
Where the Emperor of Yamato rules his country from.

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:29.680
Oh...

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:31.000
So I was thinking,

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:34.880
why don't you guys come with me?

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:35.740
What?

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:40.760
With you guys around, I bet there'll never be a dull moment.

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:43.670
I don't know, this is kinda sudden...

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:45.090
Right, Kuon?

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:46.510
Yeah,

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:48.260
we'll do just that.{~kana, habit, no "I think"}{it's a cute tick}{I just felt like it should be consistent because some of them are ignored, I guess I can list all the ~kana's so you can decide, maybe}{the new soune}{pretty sure we removed last episode's, so yeah.}{We could also sub every single one of them which is the weeb route. People would start to notice em}

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:51.470
That's right, you can't just spring that on us—

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:52.770
Wait, you agreed!?

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:55.800
The capital lies at the nation's heart, right?

00:03:55.800 --> 00:04:00.030
I think we could find a good job for you there.

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:03.630
W-Well, starting work so soon is a bit...

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:06.580
I'd like to take it easy for a bit longer.

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:09.060
U-Um, Haku-sama.

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:12.540
I'll be in your hands.

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:14.680
Huh? Uh, right...

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:15.750
Sure thing.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.290
Looks like it's decided, then.{kana}

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:20.950
Whoa, Kuon, wait a sec—

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:27.370
Now, let's get packed and say goodbye to the innkeeper.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.560
Don't I get a say in this?

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.780
Why is this happening to me?

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:52.700
I'm sorry.

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:56.330
I've never seen Kokopo be this friendly

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:58.560
with someone she's never met before.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.090
Don't sweat it.{It's all right.}

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:03.420
He's just not used to chicks rubbing up against him.{He's just embarrassed that she likes him so much.}

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:05.850
Is that so?

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:09.520
Oh, I'm sorry. I should watch my language.{Was I being too informal?}

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:11.720
No, don't worry.

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:15.200
Please call me Rurutie.

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:16.980
Okay. Nice to meet you, Rurutie.

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:19.530
Master Haku!

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:23.980
<i>Anyway...</i>

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:33.040
<i>There sure are all kinds of people here.</i>

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:56.300
Ow... my back...

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:59.740
Damn Ukon, making me walk the whole day...

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:01.520
U-Um...

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:03.110
Please, try this.

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:05.250
Ah, thanks.

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:10.660
Wow, that's good.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.510
Really, it is.

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:18.600
It has a very mellow taste.

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:20.870
I'm so glad you like it!

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.540
<i>You</i> made this, Rurutie?

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:27.800
Yes! I've always been fond of cooking.

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:31.430
Even though you're a princess, huh? That's great.

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:32.930
Th-That's not—

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:34.310
Kuon?

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:38.310
Oh, so this is where you two were.

00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:41.320
What are you doing with those buckets?

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:45.850
I'm going to get some water from the river to take a bath.

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:50.070
A bath here, in the middle of the mountains?

00:06:50.070 --> 00:06:53.820
I like to feel clean and refreshed at the end of the day.

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:55.940
Care to join me, Rurutie?

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:59.010
You're covered in soot from the fire.

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:04.070
You're right.

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:05.390
I'll go help—

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:05.960
Wait.

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:07.760
What?

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:10.430
I owe you for making me this delicious dinner.

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:14.730
I'll go get that water for you.

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:24.960
I said that to try and look cool, but I should've known better...

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:26.480
Nope, I can't go any farther...

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:29.140
A-Anybody there? I need help!

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:31.020
You called{summoned me}?

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.390
Well, not <i>anybody</i>.

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:37.130
You are my dear friend, Master Haku,

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:40.050
and I owe you for saving my life from the boro-gigiri.

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:43.120
This is a perfect opportunity to repay you!

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:45.500
That's all your life is worth to you, huh?

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:46.840
Got it...

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:57.420
Hey! Be careful!

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:05.920
I worked so hard to get that water...

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:09.400
Forgive me...

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:11.530
Now what do I do?

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:19.410
You want me to put it on your back?

00:08:19.710 --> 00:08:22.080
Are you offering to help me?

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:27.920
I dunno how I feel about asking you for help...

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:30.680
but I guess I don't have a choice.

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:35.970
You lowly Hororon bird!

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:41.390
Unforgivable!

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:45.580
This is the life...

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:48.440
Nothing beats a good bath! {kana}

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:50.050
Indeed.

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:53.440
It's warm and relaxing.

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:55.450
I'm sure you're well aware,

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:57.740
but try to peek and you'll regret it.

00:08:58.440 --> 00:08:59.450
Yeah, yeah.

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:12.340
Who's there?

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:15.860
Is that you, Haku?

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:17.840
H-Haku-sama?

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:19.590
I-I'm not ready for this...

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:22.180
Hold it right there!

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:28.940
What?

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:30.560
What's going on?

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:32.560
Haku, did you see something just then?

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:35.190
Well, I wasn't looking <i>then</i>...

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:36.390
What?

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:37.270
But I am <i>now</i>.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:08.920
Is it just me, or do we have fewer people than we did yesterday?

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:09.730
Do we?

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:11.380
You're imagining it.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:12.230
Huh?

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:15.520
I wonder what happened to her.

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:20.480
What's wrong?

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:24.490
Well, my cart got stuck in a rut.

00:10:24.490 --> 00:10:26.130
I see.

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:27.740
Give her a hand.

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:28.580
Yes, sir!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.930
Thank you for showing kindness towards a stranger.

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:38.010
If the road's blocked, it's gotta be cleared. Think nothing of it.

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:40.570
Okay, ready? Let's go!

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:42.260
One, two...

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:52.520
Unfortunately, you stopped for the wrong girl.

00:10:57.770 --> 00:10:59.440
Piece of cake.

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:06.780
Splendidly done, dear sister.

00:11:06.780 --> 00:11:08.580
Well done, Nosuri.

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:10.580
You guys bandits{thieves}?

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:12.090
As you can see.

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:22.590
Sorry, but we'll be relieving you of your cargo.

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:23.940
No...

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:27.840
Hey, this one's got a pretty face.

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:30.980
Give us a turn with her too, Boss!

00:11:30.980 --> 00:11:33.540
I'd rather have this one.

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:35.320
Patience, gentlemen.

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:38.390
Allow me to have the first taste—

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:38.390
Stop it, Mozunu!

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:42.470
That wasn't part of the deal.

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:44.860
Don't tell me you're jealous?

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:46.940
Relax.

00:11:46.940 --> 00:11:49.620
You're still the only one for me.

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:51.870
I'm telling you not to touch them.

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:57.370
Break the deal, and consider our alliance over.

00:11:58.130 --> 00:11:59.550
Fine.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:04.470
We'll be on our way, then.

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:06.690
Take care in your travels.

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:15.900
Who'd have guessed,

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:19.270
they actually planned on leaving us behind.

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:22.660
H-How can you be so calm!?

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:25.050
They just left with our offerings to the Emperor!

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:27.780
We can't afford to have them stolen.

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:29.920
What are you planning, Ukon?

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:31.760
What could you possibly mean?

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:33.060
Don't try to fool me.

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:36.290
You could've beaten them effortlessly.

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:40.040
You've got good eyes, boy.

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:54.340
You're right. This was all part of my plan.

00:12:54.780 --> 00:12:57.500
A plan to destroy those bandits.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:59.060
What? Wh-What!?

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:15.240
A dead end?

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:16.810
Just watch.

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:41.350
This way.

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:50.240
Whaddya think, Nosuri?

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:54.240
This is the hideout of the Mozunu Gang!

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:57.500
I had no idea this was here.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:01.950
The men from the capital will never find us here!

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:08.710
Our days of running from them are over.

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:12.030
Yeah. We can raze villages to the ground,

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:16.580
kidnap women and children, 
and do whatever the hell we want!

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:20.570
I'm happy too.

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:24.560
I didn't expect you to come to me.

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:28.390
We can forget about the 
problems we've had in the past,

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:30.230
and live together here as friends—

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:32.240
No, I changed my mind.

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:33.030
Huh?

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:36.160
She means our alliance is over.

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:45.000
What?

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:55.010
Do you think Master Ukon and his men are doing well?

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:57.040
No need to worry.

00:14:57.040 --> 00:15:01.020
I can't see Ukon losing to a bunch of bandits.

00:15:02.530 --> 00:15:07.050
The men hiding in the cargo should be starting to raise a ruckus right about now.

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:09.440
We're gonna head off to join them.

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:13.430
While we're away, I want you to protect Rurutie-sama.

00:15:19.490 --> 00:15:23.020
We just need to stay here and wait patiently.{kana}

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:26.840
You just laughed at me, didn't you!?

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:31.080
I'm told you've just met Ukon-sama recently.

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:31.080
Unforgivable! You stupid Hororon bird!

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:32.680
Yeah, I guess I did.

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:36.390
Why is it that you already trust him so much?

00:15:36.390 --> 00:15:37.800
I'm not really sure.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:43.020
I don't know if it's trust, but I know he's strong.

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:46.010
I'm a little jealous.

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:47.070
Really?

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:48.520
Y-Yes!

00:15:48.520 --> 00:15:52.900
I think friendship between men is a wonderful thing.{FUJOOOOO}

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:58.160
The bond of friendship between Master Haku 
and myself is indeed very strong!

00:15:58.520 --> 00:15:59.660
It really isn't.

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:14.360
Damn it! What the hell's going on?

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:15.790
Boss!

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:18.950
Report from the watchtower!

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:21.560
A force is approaching from the capital!

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:23.470
What?

00:16:23.470 --> 00:16:24.950
Hey, Nosuri!

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:26.310
What's going o—

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:28.310
Boss!

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:30.020
Stay calm.

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:34.060
We have an escape route for times like these.

00:16:40.190 --> 00:16:41.420
Master Haku...

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:47.560
We were only able to beat the boro-gigiri last time because we worked together.

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:48.230
This is so good.

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:49.550
He's not honest.{added in TLC, I'll edit these after QC cuz I haven't watched yet}

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:50.420
Where'd you get that?

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:51.420
And he's so mean.

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:52.410
I made it for lunch.

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:54.880
Would you all like some?

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:55.720
Don't mind if I do.

00:16:56.720 --> 00:16:58.240
Here, you too, Rurutie.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.450
Th-Thank you.

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:04.980
It's delicious!

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:07.150
This stuff's good even when it's cold.

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:10.030
Um...

00:17:10.030 --> 00:17:13.690
Is it really okay for us to just stay here?

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:15.990
It's fine. It's not like we'd be of any help anyway.{kana}

00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:19.870
Those look absolutely delectable, Master Kuon!

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:22.370
May I have one, as wel—

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:31.250
What's that?

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:36.370
I built a secret passage

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:39.010
just for a situation like this.

00:17:39.010 --> 00:17:40.650
As brilliant as ever, Boss.

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:41.760
You think of everything.

00:17:43.260 --> 00:17:45.440
Still, that damn Nosuri...

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:49.290
I was wrong to let my guard down just 
because of those enormous boobs of hers.{a good life lesson, boys}

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:51.020
I'll deal with her later!

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:57.780
Wh-What are you guys doing here!?

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:57.780
Wh-What are you guys doing here!?

00:17:57.780 --> 00:17:59.910
W-Well, it doesn't matter.

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:04.870
All I see are potential hostages to aid our escape!

00:18:04.870 --> 00:18:06.540
I-I won't let you do as you please.

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:09.660
Tremble before my magic!

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:13.920
ompokoko un kurakura

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:15.260
potanum pasalang

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:17.340
saen shaksam poto <i>yaaaa</i>

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:21.360
Not sure what I expected.{I fucking LOL'd}

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:24.220
Yeah, kinda saw that coming.

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:26.550
Rurutie!

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:28.930
Don't move a muscle.

00:18:30.070 --> 00:18:31.190
Oh no...

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:39.950
Don't try anything funny. I'd hate to carve up a face as pretty as hers!

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:43.710
You too, little missy! Get over here!

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:44.950
You should really stop...

00:18:46.110 --> 00:18:48.920
Damn, I'm in luck.

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:51.960
Two beautiful girls, just for me!

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:53.390
Why, you...

00:18:53.390 --> 00:18:55.080
Guess I don't have a choice.{kana}

00:18:58.330 --> 00:19:00.700
You're pretty pathetic, kid!

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:05.850
You're losing both of them, and there's not a damn thing you can do about it.

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:06.990
<i>Damn it.</i>

00:19:06.990 --> 00:19:10.530
You girls have no one to blame but yourselves

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:12.330
for trusting a loser like him.

00:19:20.370 --> 00:19:21.740
No, run!

00:19:21.740 --> 00:19:23.230
What are you saying?

00:19:23.230 --> 00:19:24.940
I can't run and leave you behind—

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:26.700
N-No...

00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:30.540
Everyone, please run!

00:19:50.770 --> 00:19:52.750
Rurutie, are you okay?

00:19:53.320 --> 00:19:54.020
Yes.

00:19:55.400 --> 00:19:59.780
Stop! Wait... Okay, I'm sorry!

00:19:56.770 --> 00:19:58.790
Well, I <i>did</i> warn you.

00:19:59.780 --> 00:20:01.160
I'm sorry.

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:04.310
Once she gets like that, there's no stopping her!

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:07.510
Help!

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.700
Boss, wait for us!

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:15.710
Who is...

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:21.780
Arrest them.

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:22.490
Yes, sir!

00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:27.370
You did well to protect Princess Rurutie.

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:28.790
You have my deepest gratitude.

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:31.320
No, we didn't really do much.

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:34.990
You should thank Kokopo instead.

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:40.860
I see Ukon's accounts{probably a better word here, reports idk} of your 
cordiality are no exaggeration.

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:45.610
I am the Royal General of the Right, Oshutoru.

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:48.840
Oshutoru, the Royal General of the Right?

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:51.900
You are headed to the capital, are you not?

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:53.620
Y-Yeah.

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:56.090
Then I'm certain this will not be the last time we meet.

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:59.260
I look forward to that day.

00:22:47.190 --> 00:22:48.330
We can see it now.

00:22:48.740 --> 00:22:49.740
That's the capital.

00:22:53.290 --> 00:22:55.550
It really is impressive.

00:22:56.750 --> 00:23:01.000
Well, it may be a <i>little</i> bigger than the capital of my homeland.

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:02.880
Just a little.

00:23:03.980 --> 00:23:08.920
Allow yours truly to be your guide in the capital, Master Haku!

00:23:15.120 --> 00:23:17.430
U-Um, Haku-sama...

00:23:17.430 --> 00:23:22.860
Would you like to look around the capital together?

00:23:22.860 --> 00:23:24.940
Sure, I'd like that.
